🚨 Urgent Road Safety Concern – Jogeshwari West
Gaurav Chaurasiya has reported the urgent need for speed breakers on the internal road from Jogeshwari MTNL towards Amboli Police Station.
The road has regular movement of vehicles and children, with schools nearby. Accidents and near-miss incidents are a serious concern.
Requesting 
@mybmc

@mybmcWardKW
 to inspect the road and install proper speed breakers/signage urgently. Please act before a serious accident occurs. 
K/West – Ward 62. Video attached for reference.
