 This scrap and garbage has been lying unattended for several months at Cama Road, Andheri West, Mumbai 400058. Despite repeated observations, it has still not been cleared. The accumulated waste is causing severe unhygienic conditions and has become a breeding ground for mosquitoes, creating a serious health risk for nearby residents, especially during the monsoon.
Kindly arrange for immediate cleaning, removal of the scrap, and regular sanitation of the area.
Location: Cama Road, Andheri West, Mumbai 400058

